#. fr: <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Type<nbsp>: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Physique / Contondant<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Élément<nbsp>: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Aucun<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Rang<nbsp>: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>★★★★<br>
